+# Existing source leaf boundaries
+
+ZK-FIX/B reduces only four newly overflowing source leaves. Their public port shapes,
+Host admission, receipt identity, native Guide, model binding and background recovery
+behavior stay unchanged. Existing lint policy and accepted older debt are not waived.
+
+- Decision request bindings and pending IDs remain in `decision-model.ts`. The
+  registry/fingerprint refresh helper performs the same original route validation.
+- Claude turn admission, Guide inbox and receipts remain in `claude.ts`. Separate
+  helpers convert materialized media, validate Host MCP callbacks and spawn the same
+  owned native subprocess; callbacks still wait for the turn owner's receipt reader.
+- Codex turn/callback state remains in `codex-turn.ts`. Its existing thread parameter
+  construction is a pure helper, keeping native settings and tool scope unchanged.
+- Background stop/execution/persistence remain in `background.ts`; its existing
+  payload builder moves beside the other pure background projections and keeps the
+  original re-export path.
+
+No new public contract, store, permission path or execution owner is introduced.
+Existing decision/native Guide/background suites and package typechecks verify the
+refactor; line-count lint uses the existing package context rather than root CLI ignore.
diff --git a/apps/zcode-cli/packages/adapters/src/model/decision-model-binding.ts b/apps/zcode-cli/packages/adapters/src/model/decision-model-binding.ts
